nment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:2ef85accfa986f08e0eec4a62072811eb38a819dc11c0fdf0820eda4a9bb7595","file":"preprints/Stretched-exponential-barriers-for-typical-SK-initial-states-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":62,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"199888ca7d3a482edb5b9916fbd83e95219be4ba278135b78747ea521800cdab","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Stretched-exponential-barriers-for-typical-SK-initial-states-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:2ef85accfa986f08e0eec4a62072811eb38a819dc11c0fdf0820eda4a9bb7595","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Stretched-exponential-barriers-for-typical-SK-initial-states-September-24-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L62"},"statement_kind":"theorem","text":"\\label{thm:main}\nSet $\\kap=1/10000$. For every fixed $\\beta>1$,\n\\begin{align*}\n \\PP_{J,\\,x_0\\sim\\pi^J}\n  \\left\\{d^J\\bigl(x_0,\\exp(n^\\kap)\\bigr)>\\frac14\\right\\}\n  &\\longrightarrow1,\\\\\n \\PP_{J,\\,x_0\\sim\\pi^J}\n  \\left\\{d_{\\mathrm{disc}}^J\n       \\bigl(x_0,\\lfloor\\exp(n^\\kap)\\rfloor\\bigr)>\\frac14\\right\\}\n  &\\longrightarrow1.\n\\end{align*}"}
